  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid the tricks the team can win by trumping: its worst side cards become trumps and its side suits shorten toward voids.",
    "opponent": "Opponents find the team void and trumping early, so leading side suits becomes dangerous.",
    "rationale": "cb-become-spade (+10.3) is the strongest common enabler. This is a larger, targeted uncommon version (about three cards) that changes only losers, so it never weakens a side honor. The common cc-twos-to-spades was too small at -2.3, and the wider rank range fixes the size.",
